	abstract = {I cross-validate the 2004 general election electorate’s demographic proﬁle available from voter registration ﬁles, the media consortium’s National Election Poll or exit poll, and the Current Population Survey within selected states. I ﬁnd voter ﬁles and Current Population Survey to be in general agreement, but the exit poll reports an electorate that is younger and composed of more minorities. All three conﬁrm a pronounced pro-woman turnout gap.},
